{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coreless</strong> is still in active development. Try out the demo \u2014 your progress will carry over to the full version if you decide to jump in and help shape its future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/c3f27fcde3a13f012899c49cdae0adb6.poster.avif?t=1758698708\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/c3f27fcde3a13f012899c49cdae0adb6.webm?t=1758698708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/c3f27fcde3a13f012899c49cdae0adb6.mp4?t=1758698708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coreless is a roguelike action game that thrives on relentless combat and escalating power. With diverse hero classes and a flexible meta-progression system, each run becomes a fast-paced surge of slaughter and growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/c4e77e6faabd9616472007b22db20f6f.poster.avif?t=1758698708\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/c4e77e6faabd9616472007b22db20f6f.webm?t=1758698708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/c4e77e6faabd9616472007b22db20f6f.mp4?t=1758698708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carnage in Every Session</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a spectacle of action and growth. Earn upgrades, amplify your Powers, and unleash Overdrives at the perfect moment. Sessions snowball into faster kills, bigger explosions, and outrageous power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/10d70485d6e48ada1be08e1f7b5c4cd6.poster.avif?t=1758698708\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/10d70485d6e48ada1be08e1f7b5c4cd6.webm?t=1758698708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/extras/10d70485d6e48ada1be08e1f7b5c4cd6.mp4?t=1758698708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action Meets Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, progression never stops \u2014 expand builds with Addons, talents, and the Research system to unlock even deadlier options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolving With You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coreless is still expanding with new content and fresh directions. Jump in now, share feedback, and help shape where the game goes next. Wishlist us \u2014 or start your journey today. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2597020?t=1758698708","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2597020?t=1758698708","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/bb6a224e2599b74946aaebf472ad000304193bf4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758698708","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597020/bb6a224e2599b74946aaebf472ad000304193bf4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758698708","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family 